stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle: construct / setup
  Idle --> Queued: enabled, state allowed, due interval
  Queued --> Queued: scheduler budget admission deferred
  Queued --> Running: relayProcess / started
  Running --> Idle: finished; clear completed snapshot
  Running --> IdleWithWork: tick budget return and nonempty snapshot
  IdleWithWork --> Queued: next eligible admission retains snapshot
  Running --> MaybeHung: elapsed exceeds warning
  MaybeHung --> ProbablyHung: elapsed exceeds alert
  ProbablyHung --> Hung: elapsed exceeds restart threshold
  Hung --> Replaced: next update handleHung / restartProcess
  Replaced --> Idle: construct same runtime type; copy configuration and owner mappings
  note right of Idle
    Disabled, paused and game-state eligibility are orthogonal.
    Paused process can be admitted but skips fire.
  end note
  note right of Running
    VERY_HIGH uses live lists and skips ordinary budget checks.
    Others copy lists and retain unfinished work snapshots.
  end note
